# Local data and credentials
# Leading slash: only the top-level data folder, not docs/data/.
# Data files live in DVC (bucket gs://fixture-ac215-96dhbm-dvc), not git.
# Git keeps only the small .dvc pointer files; `dvc pull` fetches the data.
# See docs/data/versions.md.
# `?*` rather than `*`: DVC's own ignore check reads `/data/*` as covering the
# data/ folder itself, then never finds data/source.dvc. Same meaning for git.
/data/?*
!/data/base.dvc
# The held-out classifier test set is committed too, except the writers'
# drafts and the pipeline output made when checking it.
!/data/eval/
/data/eval/*/work/
/data/eval/*/processed/
secrets/
.env

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
